#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "Payments: the reconciliations of the bill, dated by the accounting date of the payment. The real method is the payment method and journal type of the payment. When the bill was reconciled directly with a bank statement line there is no payment record: only the journal type is known and the method is reported as not identified."
msgstr ""

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "real_days: days from the bill date to the payment date, weighted by the amount of each payment. late_pct: share of the paid amount settled after the due date. delay_days of a payment: its date minus the due date (negative: early). Credit notes applied to a bill are shown apart and are not payments. Account of a bill in the payment analysis: the account of its largest analysed line."
msgstr ""

